  "description": "USDT depeg alarm (Android DepegAlarm.kt / iOS DepegAlarm.swift). threshold: stored tenths of a percent -> effective (unknown -> 5). combine: Kraken USDT/USD last and Binance USDC/USDT last (null = missing) -> USDT in USD (closer to 1 wins; implausible values outside 0.5..1.5 dropped), tolerance 1e-9. evaluate: deviation in percent, threshold in percent, armed, mayFire -> fire, armed (re-armed at half the threshold; magnitude rounded to 4 decimals, threshold inclusive). episodes: prices in order (start armed, every fired notification is posted; quiet = mayFire false) -> fired per step. mainExchange: watchlist market keys -> exchange key and URL of the 'Open exchange' button. cardWarning: last reading (price in USD, ageMillis = now - reading time; null price = no reading) and stored thresholdTenths -> shown on the portfolio card (magnitude >= threshold, same rounding as evaluate; hidden when older than 30 minutes or more than 1 minute in the future). cardNote (Build 58): «USDT = 1» line of the portfolio card independent of the alarm — holdings (coin symbols, any case), valuesViaUsdt (values hang on USDT = USD: display currency, USD or mixed exchanges) and the last reading as in cardWarning -> kind DEVIATION (fresh reading >= threshold, as today), PRICE_SOURCE («Prices: Binance · USDT = 1»), USDT_ASSUMED (holdings contain USDT, counted as 1) or null (no line). usdtMarket (default false; owner decision Oct 2026, USDT valued at its market price): a fresh plausible reading (liveUsdtUsd, up to 6 hours old) -> no line; otherwise USDT_ASSUMED whenever values depend on USDT (valuesViaUsdt or USDT held) = marker of the 1-fallback, else no line. liveUsdtUsd: last reading -> live USDT/USD for valuation if at most 6 hours old (21600000 ms; up to 60 s in the future; the cardWarning limit of 30 minutes does not apply) and within 0.5..1.5, else null.",
